    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request List Filtering Workflow\nDescription: Steps to open the filter panel and add multiple AND conditions on the Change Request list.\n- Open the filter panel by clicking the 'Show / hide filter' control (bid a47) to reveal inputs.\n- Click the field chooser combobox (e.g., a1181) for the current condition to select a field like 'Type'.\n- Click the value chooser combobox (e.g., a1639) for the selected field and use select_option to set the value (e.g., 'normal').\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition To Condition X: [Field] is [Value]' button (e.g., a1303) to append the next condition in the chain.\n- Repeat the field selection, value setting, and adding steps for fields like 'Requested by', 'Model', and 'Short description'.\n- For empty string conditions, select the 'Model' field and set the operator to 'is empty string' using the operator combobox."
