    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Filter Panel Interaction Patterns\nDescription: Key UI signals and behaviors observed when building complex AND filters on the Change Request list.\n- The filter panel is controlled by the 'change_requestfilterdiv' container and accessed via bid a47.\n- Field choosers (e.g., a1181, a1659) use hasPopup='listbox' and display '-- choose field --' by default.\n- Value choosers (e.g., a1639, a2135) use hasPopup='menu' and may require select_option if clicking options fails.\n- Buttons to add conditions are dynamically labeled as 'Add AND Condition To Condition X: [Current Field] is [Current Value]'.\n- The 'Requested by' field uses a textbox (e.g., a2118) for string input rather than a dropdown.\n- Empty string conditions require selecting a specific 'is empty string' operator from the operator combobox.\n- The filter builder enforces an AND logic structure within the 'All of these conditions must be met' group.\n- Field options in choosers are identified by specific bids (e.g., a1583 for 'Type', a1999 for 'Requested by')."
